{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:fa21e3d664b5a48b","name":"I4 Ionizer Starfighter","source":{"id":"source:reference-fa21e3d664b5a48b","title":"I4 Ionizer Starfighter","revision":20196,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:23:30Z","sha256":"73974b8a133d9e270d7e19c1efe190c6e64ab1f49d590f6dc2e4fcfb7612fd95","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20196","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=I4%20Ionizer%20Starfighter&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-fa21e3d664b5a48b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fireblue Squadron"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fireblue_Squadron","referenceId":"reference:5b9bd8ae56cfcb63"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When a military force needs to disable a ship quickly with little damage to the superstructure, no small fighter can do the job more quickly than the I4 Ionizer, developed by Koensayr. Armed with multiple ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion_Cannons"},", this ship unloads a barrage of ion energy designed to overwhelm a target's control systems. A squadron of Ionizers can disable a small freighter in a single pass and wreak havoc on larger ships with multiple attacks. Fortunately for the galaxy's merchant traffic, the I4 is a strictly regulated craft, restricted to military sales only. The vast majority wind up in Galactic Alliance fleets, but following the Alliance's surrender, some decommissioned ships find their way to smaller governments and the occasional pirate flotilla.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ship carries a single pilot plus an Astromech Droid and is Hyperspace-capable. It is well armored, but only carries light shielding due to interference between the extensive ion weaponry and the shield generators. When more lethal force is required, the pilot can fall back on the ship's underpowered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Laser Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Laser_Cannons"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ship can also carry a pair of wing-mounted Disruptor Torpedoes. These heavy, oversized torpedoes contain massive ion capacitors that discharge their energy on impact, essentially forming an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion Bomb"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion_Bomb"},". The massive jolt of energy is capable of completely burning out a ship's electrical systems (in the case of a light freighter), or seriously damage the systems near the area of impact (in the case of large ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transports"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transports","referenceId":"reference:082a04e1f80578b3"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"},"). They are generally too big and slow to be effective against agile craft such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"}," or smaller patrol ships.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["I4 Ionizer Starfighter Statistics (CL 11)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Gargantuan ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +8; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://sws